        "original_id": "8961f05a-0da7-56de-8a55-22e433a8b0e4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Magazines: Guitar World, Golf Digest\n- Companies: Condé Nast Publications, The New York Times Company\n- People: Daron Malakian, Serj Tankian, Shavo Odadjian, John Dolmayan\n- Organizations: System of a Down\n- Places: Des Moines, Iowa\n- Concepts: The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time\n\nFacts:\n- Golf Digest started in 1950.\n- Golf Digest was sold to The New York Times Company in 1969.\n- Guitar World has been published since July 1980.\n- System of a Down was formed in the mid-1990s by Serj Tankian, Daron Malakian, Shavo Odadjian, and John Dolmayan, and its members are musicians of Armenian origin.\n- Guitar World is a monthly music magazine devoted to guitarists.\n- Golf Digest is a monthly golf magazine in the United States published by Condé Nast Publications.\n- Golf Digest is headquartered in Des Moines, Iowa.\n- Daron Malakian was ranked 30th in Guitar World's list The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "2c3093da-4a5f-5763-9519-21bc1df43530",
        "text": "Page: Guitar World. Sentence: Guitar World is a monthly music magazine devoted to guitarists, published since July 1980.\nPage: Golf Digest. Sentence: Golf Digest is a monthly golf magazine published by Condé Nast Publications in the United States.\nPage: Golf Digest. Sentence: The magazine started in 1950, and was sold to The New York Times Company in 1969.\nPage: Golf Digest. Sentence: The headquarters of \"Golf Digest\" is in Des Moines, Iowa.\nPage: Daron Malakian. Sentence: He is placed 30th in Guitar World's List of The 100 Greatest Heavy Metal Guitarists of All Time.\nPage: System of a Down discography. Sentence: System of a Down is an American rock band formed by musicians of Armenian origin: vocalist Serj Tankian, guitarist Daron Malakian, bassist Shavo Odadjian, and drummer John Dolmayan in the mid-1990s.",
